      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is true for the pin with only one ALT function.\nHowever, if it is complete not true if a pin has multiple ALT functions.\nAs GPIO34/GPIO37 is a multi-function pin (i.e. ADC or PS2), the ALT function\ntable entry is guarded by \"#ifdef CONFIG_PS2\" to determine if the ALT entry is ADC or PS2. See more detail:\nhttps://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/refs/heads/main/chip/npcx/gpio_chip-npcx9.h#215.",
      "parentUuid": "94e4af7b_33845303",
