      "side": 1,
      "message": "In Primus, I defined GPIO37 as gpio GPIO_OUT_LOW and defined GPIO62/GPIO63 as PS2 ALT function and set CONFIG_PS2. After that, I found GPIO37 can not pull high using gpio_set_level(GPIO_37, 1).",
